OL,3,GNEWSAForward Guernsey want to set a
OL,4,Apathway to 5% GST
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's only registered political
OL,7,Fparty may look to increase the rate of
OL,8,FGST from 3% to 5%, after it is
OL,9,Fintroduced in 2028.
OL,11,FForward Guernsey is putting together
OL,12,Fproposals that it said would deliver
OL,13,F"broader tax reform", to give
OL,14,Fincentives to young people to stay on
OL,15,Fisland.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
