OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAForward Guernsey want to set a
OL,4,Apathway to 5% GST
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputies are due to debate proposals
OL,7,Ffrom Policy and Resources (P&R) to
OL,8,Fintroduce a 3% GST, reduce income tax
OL,9,Frates, increase tax allowances, reform
OL,10,Fsocial security contributions,
OL,11,Fre-introduce motor tax and tax
OL,12,Fcompanies more.
OL,14,FParty leader Gavin St Pier said he
OL,15,Fwanted to provide a "pathway" to see
OL,16,Fthe rate increase in the future to
OL,17,Fallow the tax system to properly be
OL,18,Freformed and provide benefits to
OL,19,Fislanders.
